      "writtenOn": "2025-10-23T21:10:20Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "IIUC this part can be skipped since pkvm hypervisor will ignore sipi_vector stored here and use one stored in pkvm\u0027s version of `pkvm_start_secondary_vcpu` that protected-guest sets.\n\nMaybe removing it and adding some comment here will be beneficial? WDYT?",
